# PART 6 — MULTIMATCH PRO ENGINE

This is the core distinguishing feature of CustomerConnect.

Implement a custom Python recommendation engine that combines hard filters and personalized ranking.

## A. Hard filters

Customers can apply multiple filters simultaneously:

- Maximum budget
- Minimum rating
- Maximum distance
- Category
- Area
- In-stock availability
- Open Now
- Verified business status
- Warranty available
- Return policy available
- WhatsApp contact available
- Phone contact available
- Email contact available
- Online payment supported
- COD supported
- Pay at Pickup supported
- Pre-booking available
- Appointment available

Hard filters must use AND logic by default.

A vendor must satisfy every selected mandatory condition to appear in exact matches.

## B. Multi-priority ranking

Allow customers to select several sorting priorities together:

- Highest Rating
- Nearest Distance
- Lowest Price
- Best Value
- Most Reviewed
- Verified Business
- Availability

Support two ranking modes:

**Weighted Smart Ranking:** Combine selected criteria into one normalized match score.

**Priority Order Sorting:** Apply criteria in the customer's chosen order, using subsequent criteria as tie-breakers.

Do not confuse filtering with sorting.

## C. SmartMatch algorithm

Implement a transparent scoring formula using normalized values.

Example:

Match Score =
0.30 × Rating Score
+ 0.25 × Distance Score
+ 0.25 × Price Score
+ 0.20 × Trust Score

Weights must be adjustable when customers change priorities.

Handle missing values carefully.

Prevent division by zero.

Explain normalization in code comments.

Do not treat the calculated score as proof of real product quality.

## D. Why This Vendor?

Show a compatibility breakdown:

- Budget match
- Rating match
- Distance convenience
- Availability
- Trust indicators
- Contact compatibility

Explain why a vendor ranked highly.

## E. Near Match

If exact matches are unavailable:

- Show a clear "No exact matches" message.
- Explain which filters may be too restrictive.
- Offer clearly labeled near matches.
- Never silently violate mandatory conditions.

